{"seq":2,"slug":"resource-flow","title":"资源流动与循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-design/game-economy/resource-flow","wordCount":1626,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"资源流动与循环\">资源流动与循环</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>资源流动（Resource Flow）是虚拟经济的血液循环——它描述了资源从创建到消耗的完整生命周期，以及在这个过程中如何驱动玩家行为。经济设计者的核心任务是构建健康的资源循环：产出端提供持续动力，消耗端创造持续需求，两者的动态平衡维持经济体系的长期稳定。</p>\n<p>&quot;水龙头-水池-排水口&quot;（Faucet-Pool-Drain）模型是分析资源流动的经典框架。水龙头代表资源产出，水池代表玩家持有量，排水口代表资源消耗。设计者需要确保水龙头不会让水池溢出（通货膨胀），排水口也不会让水池干涸（资源饥荒）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[水龙头 - 资源产出] --&gt; B[水池 - 玩家持有]&#10;    B --&gt; C[排水口 - 资源消耗]&#10;    A --&gt; D[任务奖励]&#10;    A --&gt; E[系统派发]&#10;    A --&gt; F[交易所得]&#10;    C --&gt; G[装备强化]&#10;    C --&gt; H[消耗品使用]&#10;    C --&gt; I[交易税/手续费]&#10;    C --&gt; J[修理/维护费]&#10;    B --&gt; K[存储上限控制]&#10;    subgraph 动态调节&#10;        L[监控水位] --&gt; M{水位偏离?}&#10;        M --&gt;|过高| N[增加消耗]&#10;        M --&gt;|过低| O[增加产出]&#10;        M --&gt;|正常| P[保持]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[水龙头 - 资源产出] --&gt; B[水池 - 玩家持有]\n    B --&gt; C[排水口 - 资源消耗]\n    A --&gt; D[任务奖励]\n    A --&gt; E[系统派发]\n    A --&gt; F[交易所得]\n    C --&gt; G[装备强化]\n    C --&gt; H[消耗品使用]\n    C --&gt; I[交易税/手续费]\n    C --&gt; J[修理/维护费]\n    B --&gt; K[存储上限控制]\n    subgraph 动态调节\n        L[监控水位] --&gt; M{水位偏离?}\n        M --&gt;|过高| N[增加消耗]\n        M --&gt;|过低| O[增加产出]\n        M --&gt;|正常| P[保持]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>流动模式</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>风险点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单向流动</td>\n<td>系统→玩家→系统</td>\n<td>单机 RPG</td>\n<td>后期资源堆积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双向循环</td>\n<td>玩家↔玩家</td>\n<td>MMO 自由交易</td>\n<td>通胀/垄断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>赛季重置</td>\n<td>周期清零重启</td>\n<td>赛季制游戏</td>\n<td>积累感断裂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多层联动</td>\n<td>不同资源互相转化</td>\n<td>策略/经营</td>\n<td>套利漏洞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生态循环</td>\n<td>模拟真实供需</td>\n<td>沙盒经济</td>\n<td>复杂度爆炸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"产出设计与水龙头调控\">产出设计与水龙头调控</h2><p>资源产出设计的核心目标是为玩家提供清晰、可预期且有成长感的收入来源。产出应当与玩家投入的时间和技能成正比，让每分钟的游戏时间都有明确的经济价值。</p>\n<p>产出渠道的分类和优先级：</p>\n<p><strong>可预测产出</strong>——任务奖励、日常/周常活动等固定收入。它们构成了玩家经济安全感的基础，应占总产出的 50-60%。</p>\n<p><strong>技能产出</strong>——通过高难度内容获得的额外奖励。它为技术好的玩家提供经济优势，应占总产出的 20-30%。</p>\n<p><strong>随机产出</strong>——掉落、开箱等概率性收入。它提供惊喜感和期待感，但不应成为经济支柱，应占总产出的 10-20%。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface FaucetConfig {&#10;  channels: FaucetChannel[];&#10;  dailyBudget: number;&#10;  weeklyBudget: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface FaucetChannel {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  type: &#39;predictable&#39; | &#39;skill_based&#39; | &#39;random&#39;;&#10;  outputPerSession: number;&#10;  dailyCap: number;&#10;  targetSharePercent: number;&#10;  growthWithLevel: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function calculateDailyOutput(config: FaucetConfig, playerLevel: number, channels: FaucetChannel[]): DailyOutputReport {&#10;  const outputs = channels.map((channel) =&gt; {&#10;    const levelMultiplier = 1 + channel.growthWithLevel * (playerLevel - 1);&#10;    const baseOutput = channel.outputPerSession * levelMultiplier;&#10;    const cappedOutput = Math.min(baseOutput, channel.dailyCap);&#10;    return { channel: channel.name, output: cappedOutput, type: channel.type };&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  const totalOutput = outputs.reduce((sum, o) =&gt; sum + o.output, 0);&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    channels: outputs,&#10;    totalDaily: totalOutput,&#10;    budgetUtilization: totalOutput / config.dailyBudget,&#10;    predictableRatio:&#10;      outputs.filter((o) =&gt; o.type === &#39;predictable&#39;).reduce((sum, o) =&gt; sum + o.output, 0) / totalOutput,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FaucetConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  channels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FaucetChannel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dailyBudget</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  weeklyBudget</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FaucetChannel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'predictable'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'skill_based'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'random'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  outputPerSession</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dailyCap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  targetSharePercent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  growthWithLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateDailyOutput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FaucetConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">playerLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">channels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FaucetChannel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DailyOutputReport</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> outputs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channels.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">channel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> levelMultiplier</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel.growthWithLevel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (playerLevel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> baseOutput</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel.outputPerSession </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> levelMultiplier;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> cappedOutput</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(baseOutput, channel.dailyCap);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { channel: channel.name, output: cappedOutput, type: channel.type };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> totalOutput</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outputs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> o.output, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    channels: outputs,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    totalDaily: totalOutput,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    budgetUtilization: totalOutput </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.dailyBudget,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    predictableRatio:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      outputs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> o.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'predictable'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> o.output, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalOutput,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>产出节奏设计需要匹配玩家的游戏周期。&quot;前甜后苦&quot;模式让新手快速积累资源获得正反馈，中后期逐步收紧产出以延长游戏寿命。但收紧的速度必须匹配消耗内容的增长——如果消耗增长快于产出降低，玩家会感到&quot;越玩越穷&quot;的沮丧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"消耗设计与排水口架构\">消耗设计与排水口架构</h2><p>消耗设计（Sink Design）是经济平衡中被低估但至关重要的环节。没有足够消耗的经济系统必然走向通货膨胀——资源越积越多，物价越来越高，新玩家的进入门槛不断抬升。</p>\n<p>消耗设计的层次模型：</p>\n<p><strong>必要消耗</strong>——玩家必须支付才能推进的核心消耗。如装备修理、技能学习、关卡入场费。这层消耗保证了最基础的资源回收。</p>\n<p><strong>优化消耗</strong>——非必须但能带来显著提升的消耗。如装备强化、宝石镶嵌、附魔。这层消耗吸引追求效率的玩家。</p>\n<p><strong>展示消耗</strong>——纯外观或社交性质的消耗。如时装、坐骑、头衔。这层消耗对战斗力无影响，但满足玩家的自我表达需求。</p>\n<p><strong>竞争消耗</strong>——与其他玩家竞争相关的消耗。如竞技场入场费、公会战物资。这层消耗随社交活跃度波动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 消耗层次&#10;        S1[必要消耗] --&gt;|保底回收| R1[基础平衡]&#10;        S2[优化消耗] --&gt;|效率追求| R2[深度消耗]&#10;        S3[展示消耗] --&gt;|自我表达| R3[长尾消耗]&#10;        S4[竞争消耗] --&gt;|社交驱动| R4[活跃消耗]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 消耗层次\n        S1[必要消耗] --&gt;|保底回收| R1[基础平衡]\n        S2[优化消耗] --&gt;|效率追求| R2[深度消耗]\n        S3[展示消耗] --&gt;|自我表达| R3[长尾消耗]\n        S4[竞争消耗] --&gt;|社交驱动| R4[活跃消耗]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>消耗类型</th>\n<th>回收效率</th>\n<th>玩家接受度</th>\n<th>设计难度</th>\n<th>比重建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>必要消耗</td>\n<td>高且稳定</td>\n<td>中性</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>30-40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化消耗</td>\n<td>中等波动</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>25-35%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>展示消耗</td>\n<td>低但持续</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>15-20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竞争消耗</td>\n<td>高但不稳定</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>10-15%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>消耗设计的关键原则是&quot;玩家愿意花&quot;——强制性过高的消耗会引发抱怨，但完全自愿的消耗可能不足以维持平衡。设计者需要在&quot;不得不花&quot;和&quot;想要花&quot;之间找到合适的比例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资源转化与价值链\">资源转化与价值链</h2><p>资源转化（Resource Conversion）定义了不同资源之间的兑换关系，构成了游戏经济的&quot;汇率体系&quot;。合理的资源转化链路为玩家提供灵活性——当某种资源过剩时可以转化为需要的资源，减少浪费感。</p>\n<p>但资源转化也是经济漏洞的高发区。如果存在一条转化路径，使得 A→B→C→A 的循环能够产生净收益，玩家就会无限循环套利，迅速摧毁经济平衡。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ConversionRule {&#10;  from: { resourceId: string; amount: number };&#10;  to: { resourceId: string; amount: number };&#10;  fee: number;&#10;  cooldown: number;&#10;  dailyLimit: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function detectArbitrage(rules: ConversionRule[]): ArbitrageResult[] {&#10;  const graph = buildConversionGraph(rules);&#10;  const cycles = findAllCycles(graph);&#10;&#10;  return cycles&#10;    .map((cycle) =&gt; {&#10;      let value = 1;&#10;      for (let i = 0; i &lt; cycle.length - 1; i++) {&#10;        const rule = findRule(rules, cycle[i], cycle[i + 1]);&#10;        if (rule) {&#10;          value *= (rule.to.amount / rule.from.amount) * (1 - rule.fee);&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;      return { cycle, netGain: value - 1, profitable: value &gt; 1 };&#10;    })&#10;    .filter((result) =&gt; result.profitable);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function buildConversionGraph(rules: ConversionRule[]): Map&lt;string, Array&lt;{ target: string; rate: number }&gt;&gt; {&#10;  const graph = new Map&lt;string, Array&lt;{ target: string; rate: number }&gt;&gt;();&#10;  for (const rule of rules) {&#10;    const edges = graph.get(rule.from.resourceId) ?? [];&#10;    edges.push({&#10;      target: rule.to.resourceId,&#10;      rate: (rule.to.amount / rule.from.amount) * (1 - rule.fee),&#10;    });&#10;    graph.set(rule.from.resourceId, edges);&#10;  }&#10;  return graph;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ConversionRule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resourceId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  to</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resourceId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  fee</span><spa